WEBVTT

00:03:57.577 --> 00:04:01.956
and I certainly don't like questionnaires
that are like Cosmo quizzes.

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:04.454
So I just copied
and pasted from my résumé.

00:04:04.478 --> 00:04:09.911
(Laughter)

00:04:09.935 --> 00:04:12.559
So in the descriptive part up top,

00:04:12.583 --> 00:04:14.885
I said that I was
an award-winning journalist

00:04:14.909 --> 00:04:16.515
and a future thinker.

00:04:16.539 --> 00:04:19.877
When I was asked about fun activities
and my ideal date,

00:04:19.901 --> 00:04:24.087
I said monetization
and fluency in Japanese.

00:04:24.111 --> 00:04:25.804
I talked a lot about JavaScript.

00:04:25.828 --> 00:04:27.051
(Laughter)

00:04:27.075 --> 00:04:33.202
So obviously this was not the best way
to put my most sexy foot forward.